%N A401336 Decimal expansion of Sum_{n>=1} (n^(1/n) - 1)/n.
%F A401336 Equals Sum_{k>=1} ((-1)^k/k!) * zeta^(k)(k+1).
%F A401336 Equals Sum_{k>=1} 1/k^(k+1) - 2*Integral_{t=0..oo} Im(((1+i*t)^(1/(1+i*t)) - 1)/(1+i*t))/(exp(2*Pi*t) - 1) dt (Abel-Plana).
%F A401336 Sum_{k>=1} 1/k^(k+1) = Integral_{x=0..1} (x^(-x) - 1)/x dx.
